# Deliberately conservative. Several commands read repo files at run time — the
# todo group reads TODO.yml and labels.yml straight off disk — so excluding
# "obviously useless" content here surfaces later as a command that cannot find
# its input. Only genuinely reinstalled, regenerated or secret paths belong
# below.

# Reinstalled in the image, and a host copy would be the wrong platform anyway.
node_modules
dist
coverage

# Secrets belong to run time, never to an image layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# History and CI metadata: large, and nothing reads them at run time.
.git
.github

# Local tool caches.
.claude
.prek
*.log
.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea
